        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/34f0e0/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2022-03-07T18:39:56.116Z",
        "cooked": "<p>LOOKING FOR PLAYERS – SENTINEL COMICS RPG</p>\n<p>Hi there! I’m an experienced DM who’s been playing and DMing in DnD, Pathfinder, Forged in the Dark systems, WarhammerFRP, Alien RPG and more for going on 8 ish years. I’d like to change things up every once in a while though, so right now I’m looking to try out a new system, and to introduce some new players to it along with me.</p>\n<p>I’ve long wanted to play in or DM a comic book superhero type adventure. And although a few out there do exist, none really had that spirit and feeling I was after until I found this fantastic game. So this time around, me and my few players are looking for a few additional heroes to join us in our heroic tales of adventure! I’m looking for 2-3 outgoing players who are enthusiastic to bring their creativity and super-powered alter egos to life!</p>\n<p>We will play on Friday evenings at around 6 PM MST (8 PM EST), will be using Discord for voice chat, and Foundry VTT will be used for dice rolls and gameplay.</p>\n<p>Please reach out to me here, or feel free to contact me via discord at KavoLatte#5091 if you’re interested or have any questions. Thanks!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2022-03-07T18:39:56.116Z",
